# Pairs with RestoredCutNotReAdvanced. Production before issue #4593: the apply
# seam routes a delivery to whatever copy the alias resolves to when it lands, so
# a pre-cutover write a stale cached gate admitted before the pause lands on the
# restored copy after the alias swap.
MODULE: RestoredCutNotReAdvancedCopyFenceDropped
TARGET: RestoredCutNotReAdvanced
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: the apply seam never checks the copy it routed to
PERTURBS: Land

--- FIND
          IN \/ p \in closed[d]
             \/ r.ep < floor[d][p]
--- REPLACE
          IN \* MUTATION: no closed-copy or admission-epoch check.
             FALSE
--- END
